### Daily summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/summary?businessId=c6c8e088-50e1-4d69-8de9-793ce6cd0046&date=2026-11-12


### Add appointment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/ghost
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": "0c9e19bf-9d7c-4298-8f5a-c690b971e266",
  "serviceId": "190e8500-94df-46c4-b7c2-ce763e88a4ae",
  "employeeId": "b3b5a03f-be06-48ee-b351-18e3d01e51ef",
  "clientName": "Ava Maria",
  "clientPhone": "+40712345678",
  "clientEmail": "ava.maria@example.com",
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "paymentMethod": "Physical",
  "clientNote": "First appointment. Hello"
}

